# gnome-menus -- the freedesktop menu specification implementation. gnome-shell
# reads it to build the application grid, and gnome-control-center's Default
# Applications panel resolves categories through it.
#
# The smallest package in this wave: one library, one .pc, a typelib, and the
# menu XML. It needs nothing but glib.
#
# BLFS 12.4, pinned here rather than in versions.env: versions.env is
# regenerated wholesale from the LFS book by tools/pin-versions.sh, so a desktop
# pin placed there is destroyed by the next `make pin`.
SRC_URL=https://download.gnome.org/sources/gnome-menus/3.36/gnome-menus-3.36.0.tar.xz
SRC_SHA256=d9348f38bde956fc32753b28c1cde19c175bfdbf1f4d5b06003b3aa09153bb1f
SRC_DIR=gnome-menus-3.36.0

# --enable-introspection is stated rather than inherited. configure.ac:68 is
# GOBJECT_INTROSPECTION_CHECK([0.9.5]), whose macro defaults to `auto` -- it
# builds the typelib if g-ir-scanner happens to be on PATH and silently does not
# if it is not. gobject-introspection IS packaged here, so the default would
# resolve; naming it means an image without it fails at configure rather than
# producing a gnome-menus with no typelib, which is the half gnome-shell
# actually consumes (it is a GJS application and reaches this library through
# introspection, never by linking it).
# --sysconfdir=/etc IS LOAD-BEARING AND THE ASSERTION FOUND IT, NOT THE READING.
# layout/Makefile.am:1 is `menudir = $(sysconfdir)/xdg/menus`, and the generic
# build.sh passes --prefix=/usr -- so autotools' default of ${prefix}/etc put
# gnome-applications.menu at /usr/etc/xdg/menus: installed, correct-looking, and
# somewhere nothing reads. The dry-build stopped on install.sh's check for it.
#
# The same convention every autotools recipe here that installs into /etc
# already follows -- attr, bluez, eudev, e2fsprogs, fuse3, libndp, libnl,
# shadow, weston, ostree all pass it -- and the same shape cups hits from the
# opposite direction, where the fix is to pass NO --prefix at all because its
# layout assumes prefix=/.
CONFIGURE_ARGS="--disable-static --enable-introspection --sysconfdir=/etc"
